   "verbSense": "painful, it hurts; on its own, 'ouch!'",
   "englishVerb": "have",
   "trap": "Not a 'have' sentence: the head hurts, atama ga itai. The noun zutsuu exists (zutsuu ga suru, zutsuuyaku), but in conversation atama itai comes first.",
